Package: vectorscan
Title: R Bindings to Vectorscan and Hyperscan
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compile and scan high-performance regular expression databases
    using Vectorscan or Hyperscan from R. The package exposes block, vectored,
    and streaming scans with R-friendly match results and callback support.
